v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我們來學習作者的寫作手法：","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.文章結構安排：導入問題→背景→具體例子與道理→總結主旨","n":29,"ssz":"....................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.主旨如何形成的：例子（故事）→概念（道理）→主旨（總結句）","n":31,"ssz":"...........1..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、寫作手法：看見本文的結構\n本文採用「導入問題→背景→例子與道理→總結主旨」的結構，請參考課文，並在【  】填入對應的段落數。","n":64,"ssz":".............................1............................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、寫作手法：看見本文的結構","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文採用「導入問題→背景→例子與道理→總結主旨」的結構，請參考課文，並在【  】填入對應的段落數。","n":49,"ssz":"..............1............................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"結構","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"導入問題","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"背景","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"例子與道理","n":5,"ssz":".1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].columns[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"總結主旨","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].rows[0].結構","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段落數","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、先找主旨（明示）\n本篇的主旨明示在結尾段。閱讀其他文章時，可以先查看開頭、結尾，以及反覆出現的觀念。","n":52,"ssz":"...................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、先找主旨（明示）","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本篇的主旨明示在結尾段。閱讀其他文章時，可以先查看開頭、結尾，以及反覆出現的觀念。","n":41,"ssz":"........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.請在主旨段落，找出本文明示的主旨。（單選）","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"外在的一切可能被奪走，但我仍能決定用什麼態度回應遭遇。","n":27,"ssz":"...11..................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"法蘭柯戰後創設意義治療法，幫助很多人。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.把主旨拆成兩個「關鍵面向」（單選）","n":19,"ssz":"........1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"痛苦很可怕 vs 人要更堅強","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"外在可能被奪走 vs 內在仍可選擇","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、主旨怎麼來的？從例子中的轉折，推出本文的道理\n你已經知道文章結構與主旨，接下來，我們要從段5~9例子中的轉折推出概念，再檢查這些概念如何共同支持主旨。","n":77,"ssz":"...........1.......................................1........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、主旨怎麼來的？從例子中的轉折，推出本文的道理","n":24,"ssz":"...........1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"你已經知道文章結構與主旨，接下來，我們要從段5~9例子中的轉折推出概念，再檢查這些概念如何共同支持主旨。","n":52,"ssz":"..........................1........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）例子→概念：用例子中的轉折推出作者想說的道理\n這篇文章的每一個例子，都有一個「轉折」，把讀者從「A：外在很糟」推向「B：內在仍能…」。用A襯托B，讓B成為重點。\n以下例子，請你圈出或補上轉折詞，再判斷作者透過這些例子要凸顯什麼概念？","n":119,"ssz":"....1......1....................11.1...11..............................................1......................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）例子→概念：用例子中的轉折推出作者想說的道理","n":25,"ssz":"....1......1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章的每一個例子，都有一個「轉折」，把讀者從「A：外在很糟」推向「B：內在仍能…」。用A襯托B，讓B成為重點。","n":57,"ssz":"......11.1...11.........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以下例子，請你圈出或補上轉折詞，再判斷作者透過這些例子要凸顯什麼概念？","n":35,"ssz":"...1......................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）例子→概念","n":8,"ssz":"....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表格四欄（欄名照原稿）：段／原文（請圈出或在【】補上轉折詞）／轉折：對比什麼（單選）／欲凸顯的概念","n":49,"ssz":"................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「原文」欄的轉折詞答案有兩種載體：第 5、6、7 段是**紅色字元框線**（w:bdr color=EE0000）圈住\n「但／但／竟然」；第 8、9 段是印在【 】裡的橘字「但」。原稿混用兩種寫法。","n":99,"ssz":"..................................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「原文」欄的轉折詞答案有兩種載體：第 5、6、7 段是**紅色字元框線**（w:bdr color=EE0000）圈住","n":59,"ssz":"..........................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「但／但／竟然」；第 8、9 段是印在【 】裡的橘字「但」。原稿混用兩種寫法。","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段5","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"集中營裡食物匱乏，一口麵包都可能關乎生死，但仍有瘦弱的難友把最後一口麵包分享出去。","n":41,"ssz":".........2......................2........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].items[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"但","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].items[0].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色字元框線（w:bdr color=EE0000）圈住「但」","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"轉折：對比什麼（單選）","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[0].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人仍能決定【　】的高度","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段6","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"獄卒辱罵：「你們根本不配喝這碗湯。」但有難友情緒不受影響，只說：「他們罵的不是事實…」","n":43,"ssz":"..........1.............1............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[1].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我可以選擇不讓【　】定義我","n":13,"ssz":".....1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段7","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"年輕女子失去所有親人、即將離世，她竟然是「愉快的」…仍能感恩","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].items[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"竟然","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].items[0].answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色字元框線（w:bdr color=EE0000）圈住「竟然」","n":32,"ssz":"................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[2].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我仍能抓住【　】來得到平靜與感恩","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[3].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段8","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[3].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"腳凍傷、腫脹、踉蹌前行，【　】靠想念太太最終走到目的地","n":27,"ssz":"...................1.....2."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[3].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"【　】能支撐我走下去","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[4].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段9","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[4].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一群瘦骨嶙峋、失溫顫抖的難友，【　】能被黎明之美打動、能心存驚嘆","n":32,"ssz":"2..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].items[4].items[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"人的內在仍保有【　】","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（二）概念→主旨：五個概念是否能支持主旨？\n主旨：外在的一切可能被奪走，但我仍能決定用什麼態度回應遭遇。\n主旨是一句話，但你要看見：前面的概念如何共同支撐它：在壞事不可逆轉時，我仍可決定什麼？（以下均為單選）","n":104,"ssz":"..........1.................11..................1.......1..............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（二）概念→主旨：五個概念是否能支持主旨？","n":21,"ssz":"..........1.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主旨：外在的一切可能被奪走，但我仍能決定用什麼態度回應遭遇。","n":30,"ssz":"......11..................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"主旨是一句話，但你要看見：前面的概念如何共同支撐它：在壞事不可逆轉時，我仍可決定什麼？（以下均為單選）","n":51,"ssz":"...1..............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（二）概念→主旨","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"表格四欄（欄名照原稿）：段／概念（道理）／是否支持主旨／我可以決定什麼","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[0].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"即使情況壞到極點，人仍能決定自己道德與品格的高度","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[0].items[1].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我可以決定什麼","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].items[1].items[0].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"